==English==

===Etymology===
Multiple origins. Partially from post-Classical {{bor|en|la|emphysema||swelling}}, from {{der|en|grc|ἐμφυσᾶν||puff up}}, from {{m|en|grc|ἐν|in|tr=en}} + {{m|en|grc|φῦσα|wind|tr=phûsa}}. Also borrowed from {{bor|en|frm|emphysema}}, from the same Latin source; compare {{cog|fr|emphysème}}. Attested from the late 16th century.<ref>{{R:OED Online|emphysema|n|61322|March 2014}}</ref>
{{wikipedia}}

